>
  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Good time management for students and freshers is a weekly plan with three priorities, two protected focus blocks a day and a short Saturday review.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities are delivering on time and building a high-income skill portfolio with a reliable habit behind it, because AI can plan a week but cannot keep the habit for you.
  </p>

  <div class="key-takeaways">
    <p class="key-takeaways__label">The short version</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Short answer:</strong> three priorities, two focus blocks, one weekly review.</li>
      <li><strong>Evidence:</strong> your own week of time notes. We quote no survey figures.</li>
      <li><strong>Growth:</strong> running a small service on time and project roles have the most headroom, and they are the base of an earlier path to financial freedom.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

